<title>YUGOSLAVIA: Yugo Fec copper ore output slightly up on Jan.</title>
<headline>Yugo Fec copper ore output slightly up on Jan.</headline>
<dateline>BELGRADE 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> YUGOSLAV NON-FERROUS ORES     FEB 97    JAN 97    FEB 96</p>
<p> copper (thousand tonnes)	1,624	1,467     1,712</p>
<p> lead-zinc				70	   58	  73</p>
<p> bauxite				  45	   --	  25</p>
<p>NON-FERROUS METAL PRODUCTION</p>
<p> electrolytic copper (tonnes)  4,958	9,718     5,274</p>
<p> refined lead			1,176	1,550     2,504</p>
<p> zinc				  2,950	2,170     1,735</p>
<p> aluminium ingots		  5,285	5,419     2,305</p>
<p> refined silver (kilos)	  5,526	4,936     5,901</p>
<p>-- Beti Bilandzic, Belgrade newsroom 381 11 222 43 05</p>
</text>
